Day 2 & Deep Sequence Modeling & Lab 2: 计算机视觉 \\
Day 3 & Deep Computer Vision & Lab 3: 大语言模型 \\
Day 4 & Deep Generative Modeling & -- \\
Day 5 & Deep Reinforcement Learning & Final Project \\
